                              `( (S ,ARROW aB) (S ,ARROW bC)
                                 (S ,ARROW ,EMP)
                                 (A ,ARROW aC) (A ,ARROW bB)
                                 (A ,ARROW a)  (A ,ARROW b)
                                 (B ,ARROW aS) (B ,ARROW bA)
                                 (B ,ARROW a)  (B ,ARROW b)
                                 (C ,ARROW aA) (C ,ARROW bS)
                                 (C ,ARROW a)  (C ,ARROW b))
                              'S))



